{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09567","headline":"登北庭北楼呈幕中诸公 · 岑参","name":"登北庭北楼呈幕中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝读西域传，汉家得轮台。\n古塞千年空，阴山独崔嵬。\n二庭近西海，六月秋风来。\n日暮上北楼，杀气凝不开。\n大荒无鸟飞，但见白龙塠。\n旧国眇天末，归心日悠哉。\n上将新破胡，西郊绝烟埃。\n边城寂无事，抚劒空徘徊。\n幸得趋幕中，托身厕羣才。\n早知安边计，未尽平生怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09567.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09567","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}